   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2021 CORE SUPPORT GAVI VACCINE ALLIANCE 2021-2025 STRATEGY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Voluntary core funding in support of Gavi 2021-2025 strategy with the overall vision of leaving no-one behind with immunisation, to reach and immunise children in developing countries, who need vaccines most. Gavi purchases and delivers vaccines for children in more than 70 countries with a mission &#x2018;to save children&#x2019;s lives and protect people&#x2019;s health by increasing access to immunisation in the world&#x2019;s poorest countries.&#x2019; Gavi is also working to ensure country readiness for vaccine deployment, building on its success with other vaccines such as measles and polio.</narrative>
  </description>
